---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import SpotlightImage from '../../components/SpotlightImage.astro';
---
<MainLayout 
  title="On-Page SEO Optimization Orange County CA | OCWebPros" 
  description="On-page SEO optimization for Orange County businesses. Keyword-focused updates to titles, meta descriptions, headings, internal links, and page copy that turn existing pages into ranking assets."
  bodyClass="page-services page-on-page-seo"
  pageCSS="/css/pages/services.css">

  <header class="relative pt-32 sm:pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-12 sm:pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 text-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[90vw] max-w-[800px] h-[400px] sm:h-[500px] md:h-[600px] glow-bg pointer-events-none opacity-40"></div>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-xs font-medium text-orange-400 mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        On-Page SEO
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">
        On-Page SEO Optimization for <span class="text-gradient-orange">Orange County</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        Your pages already exist - we make them rank. Keyword-focused refinement of title tags, meta descriptions, headings, internal links, and page copy so every page targets the right search term and matches what searchers actually want.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mt-8">
        <a href="/contact/" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-orange-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors btn-glow text-sm md:text-base">
          Request a Consult
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing/" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-semibold rounded-full border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors text-sm md:text-base">
          View Pricing
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="pb-16 sm:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
    <!-- Spotlight -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-8 md:pt-12 pb-16 md:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10" data-aos="fade-right">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">Make Every Page Earn Its Rankings</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">Most local business websites don't need more pages - they need the pages they have to work harder. We map each page to one target keyword, then align every on-page element to it: no redesign, no rebuild, just measurable ranking improvements.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>One page, one keyword - a clear map with no pages competing against each other</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Titles and meta descriptions written to rank and earn the click</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Internal links that pass authority to the pages that drive revenue</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Copy tuned to search intent - what ranks, not just what sounds good</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <SpotlightImage
          src="/images/unsplash/services-seo-strategy.jpg"
          alt="Reviewing on-page SEO metrics and page optimizations on a laptop"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What We Optimize -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-2 md:pt-4 pb-16 md:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900">What On-Page Optimization Includes</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">Six on-page levers, applied page by page across your site - each one backed by keyword data, not guesswork.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 8h10M7 12h4m1 8l-4-4H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-3l-4 4z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Title Tags &amp; Meta Descriptions</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The first thing Google and searchers see. We write titles that include your target keyword naturally and descriptions that lift click-through rate.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Heading Structure</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">A logical H1-H2-H3 hierarchy that mirrors how people search - making pages easier for Google, AI Overviews, and skimming visitors to understand.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Internal Linking</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Strategic links with descriptive anchor text that route authority to your money pages and help Google understand your site's structure.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Page Copy Refinement</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Existing copy reworked to cover the subtopics and questions Google expects on a ranking page - without keyword stuffing or losing your voice.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Image Optimization</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Descriptive file names, alt text, and compression - small details that add up in image search, accessibility, and page speed.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Schema Markup</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Service, FAQ, and LocalBusiness structured data added where it earns rich results - and keeps your pages visible in AI-driven search.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Process -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-100">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">How We Optimize a Page</h2>
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-between relative">
        <div class="absolute top-6 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 bg-orange-500/30 -z-10"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Audit</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Review current rankings, content, and on-page gaps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="150">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Map Keywords</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Assign one primary keyword and intent to each page.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Optimize</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Update titles, headings, copy, links, and schema.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="450">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">4</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Track</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Monitor rankings and CTR, then iterate on the results.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:hidden space-y-8">
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">1</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Audit</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Review current rankings, content, and on-page gaps.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">2</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Map Keywords</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Assign one primary keyword and intent to each page.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">3</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Optimize</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Update titles, headings, copy, links, and schema.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">4</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Track</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Monitor rankings and CTR, then iterate on the results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Related -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8" data-aos="fade-up">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Start with a Technical Audit</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">On-page work performs best on a technically sound site. A technical SEO audit finds the crawl, speed, and indexing issues to fix first.</p>
          <a href="/services/technical-seo-audits/" class="text-sm text-orange-400 font-medium hover:text-orange-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Explore technical SEO audits
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Need New Content Too?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">When optimization reveals gaps your existing pages can't cover, our content marketing service plans and writes the articles and service pages to fill them.</p>
          <a href="/services/content-marketing/" class="text-sm text-orange-400 font-medium hover:text-orange-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Explore content marketing
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">Your pages can rank higher than they do today</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">Request a consult and we'll show you which pages are closest to page one - and what it takes to get them there.</p>
      <div class="inline-flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a href="/contact/" class="px-10 py-5 bg-orange-700 text-white font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors text-lg btn-glow">
          Request a consult
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing/" class="px-10 py-5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-full border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors text-lg">
          View all pricing
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-3">Prefer a call? Add your number in the email.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
